        output='[{\'type\': \'text\', \'text\': \'3. The UFZ recognizes the [FAIR\\nprinciples](research-data-management/01-digital-research-data.md#fair-principles-and-open-data)[^5]\\nas the superordinate principles for the sustainable provision of research data\\ncollected at the UFZ (see Appendix 1).\\n\\n4. The UFZ supports national and international declarations on the handling of\\n   research data.\\n\\n## 2 Scope of the Rules for the Responsible Handling of Research Data at the UFZ\\n\\n3. The UFZ recognizes the [FAIR principles](../research-data-management/01-digital-research-data.md#fair-principles-and-open-data)[^5] as the superordinate principles for the sustainable\\nprovision of research data collected at the UFZ (see Appendix 1).\\n\\n4. The UFZ supports national and international declarations on the handling of research data.\\n\\n## 2 Scope of the Rules for the Responsible Handling of Research Data at the UFZ\\n\\n??? note "Metadata"\\n    Category | Name | Institution\\n    ---|---|---\\n    Persistent identifier(PID) | [B2HANDLE](https://eudat.eu/service-catalogue/b2handle) |European(EUDA)\\n    | [dara DOI](https://dev.berd-nfdi.de/dara-for-doi-registration/) | BERD4NFDI\\n    | [ORCID](https://orcid.org/) | ORCID\\n    | [PID Service](https://projects.tib.eu/pid-service/en/) | TIB\\n    | [Register a data DOI](https://rdm.pages.ufz.de/guidelines/practice-ufz/DMP/Archiv/DOI-registration-for-research-data/) | UFZ\\n\\n+ **Analyze**: Analysis apps can access images on OMERO and save results back to the server.\\nOMERO.scripts run on the server itself and can be launched from the clients\\n\\n+ **Publish and export**: Publish your data straight from the server with an embedded viewer or link to a separate app.\\nUse the permissions system to regulate access to this public data. Download original image files or export as OME-TIFF\\n\\n## OMERO at UFZ\\n\\n??? note "Data Transfer"\\n    Category | Name | Institution\\n    ---|---|---\\n    File transfer     | [Bulk Data Transfer](https://open-science-cloud.ec.europa.eu/services/bulk-data-transfer) | European(EOSC)\\n    | [Large File Transfer](https://open-science-cloud.ec.europa.eu/services/large-file-transfer) | European (EOSC)\\n    | [SFTP](https://www.intranet.ufz.de/index.php?en=45103) | UFZ\', \'id\': \'lc_782414ec-0737-4659-889f-34411827ab4c\'}]'
